⍝ CircleFunctions.tc
⍝ ══════════════════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: A integer ¯12≤A≤12; B and Z numeric
      ⍝ inv: 4○B ←→ (1+B*2)*.5   (√(1+R²))
      B ← ⎕RVAL 1 (,4) (,0 0 1 0 0)
      (4○B) ≡ (1+B*2)*.5
1
      ⍝ inv: ¯4○B ←→ (¯1+B*2)*.5  (√(R²-1)) — requires |B|≥1
      B ← 1+(|⎕RVAL 1 (,4) (,0 0 1 0 0))
      (¯4○B) ≡ (¯1+B*2)*.5
1
      ⍝ inv: ¯8○B ←→ -8○B
      B ← ⎕RVAL 1 (,4) (,0 0 1 0 0)
      (¯8○B) ≡ -8○B
1
      ⍝ inv: Hyperbolic: 7○B ←→ (5○B)÷6○B   (tanh = sinh/cosh)
      (7○B) ≡ (5○B)÷6○B
1
      ⍝ inv: Complex: B ←→ ¯10 ¯11 +.○ 9 11 ∘.○ B
      B ← ⎕RVAL 1 (,3) (,0 0 1 0 0)
      B ≡ ¯10 ¯11 +.○ 9 11 ∘.○ B
1
      ⍝ inv: B ←→ ¯9 ¯12 ×.○ 10 12 ∘.○ B
      B ≡ ¯9 ¯12 ×.○ 10 12 ∘.○ B
1
